.TH TEMPLATE-REVAMPED 1 "2026-11-16" "template-revamped" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
template-revamped \- the starting point for a tmux-revamped plugin
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B template-revamped
.RB [ \-\-theme
.IR name ]
.B doctor
.br
.B template-revamped version
.br
.B template-revamped help
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B template-revamped
is the command every tmux-revamped plugin starts from. It binds no key and
draws no placeholder, and it answers the three commands every member answers.
.PP
Run with no command on a terminal, it offers a menu.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B doctor
Print one row per dependency: tmux, gum, the desktop notifier and the core
tools, each with its path and, for a core tool, its flavor and version.
Exits 1 only when a required tool is missing.
.TP
.B version
Print the version, then the tmux version.
.TP
.B help
Print the help page.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-theme " name"
Colours of the terminal interface:
.BR kodougu ,
.BR catppuccin\-mocha ,
.BR catppuccin\-latte ,
.BR dracula ,
.BR nord ,
.BR gruvbox ,
.B tokyo\-night
or
.BR mono .
The default is
.BR kodougu .
.PP
The option also takes the form
.IR \-\-theme = name .
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B TEMPLATE_REVAMPED_THEME
The theme when
.B \-\-theme
is not given.
.TP
.B TEMPLATE_REVAMPED_ACCENT
A colour such as #CBA6F7 that replaces the accent of the theme.
.TP
.B KODOUGU_THEME
The theme of every kodougu and tmux-revamped tool, when neither
.B \-\-theme
nor
.B TEMPLATE_REVAMPED_THEME
is set.
.TP
.B KODOUGU_ACCENT
The accent of every kodougu and tmux-revamped tool, when
.B TEMPLATE_REVAMPED_ACCENT
is not set.
.TP
.B NO_COLOR
Turns colour off in every theme.
.SH TMUX OPTIONS
.TP
.B @revamped_theme
The theme of every tmux-revamped tool, when nothing else sets one. The default
is
.BR kodougu .
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 on success, 1 on any failure.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tmux (1),
.BR gum (1)
